"Ecosystem - alexar76/aicom GitHub Wiki (https://github-wiki-see.page/m/alexar76/aicom/wiki/Ecosystem)\nciteturn40search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; # Ecosystem - alexar76/aicom GitHub Wiki ... SKOPOS  | `skopos/` → alexar76/skopos  | Fleet observability + remediation conductor · skopos.modelmarket.dev\n\n# Ecosystem - alexar76/aicom GitHub Wiki\n\n# AICOM ecosystem — role of AI-Factory\n\nThe AICOM monorepo is not only a self-hosted code generator. It is a supply-side factory inside a federated AIMarket stack: ship products on your server, expose them as machine-readable capabilities, list them on a hub, and let desktop apps, widgets, and autonomous agents discover, pay, and invoke them.\n\n> Deep reference (Mermaid, C4, deployment): `docs/ecosystem/knowledge-base.md` · `docs/ecosystem-architecture.md` · `aimarket-protocol/ecosystem.md` · interactive viewer: `aimarket-protocol/ecosystem-viewer.html`\n\n## Two planes\n\nPlane  | What it does  | Public face\n--- | --- | ---\nAI-Factory (this repo core)  | Multi-agent pipeline turns ideas into shippable web products (landing or full stack), runs storefront + admin, owns keys and gates  | magic-ai-factory.com · `:9080` self-host\nAIMarket (same monorepo)  | Federation hub indexes capabilities, routes invoke, runs plugins (safety, escrow, reputation), settles on-chain  | modelmarket.dev · Hub `:9083`\n\nFactory = producer. Hub = marketplace router. Desktop SKUs, embed widget, and `aimarket_agent` SDK are consumers.\n\n## Where AI-Factory sits (one picture)\n    \n    flowchart TB\n      subgraph factory[\"AI-Factory · magic-ai-factory.com\"]\n        IDEA[\"Idea / Discovery\"]\n        PIPE[\"13-agent pipeline + QA gates\"]\n        ART[\"Artifacts · pipeline.db · sandbox\"]\n        STORE[\"Storefront + crypto checkout\"]\n        WELL[\"/.well-known/ai-market.json\"]\n        GW[\"Protocol gateway v1<br/>402 · MCP · invoke\"]\n        IDEA --> PIPE --> ART\n        ART --> STORE\n        ART --> WELL\n        ART --> GW\n      end\n    \n      subgraph hub[\"AIMarket Hub · modelmarket.dev\"]\n        BRIDGE[\"factory_bridge · auto_listing\"]\n        IDX[\"Capability index\"]\n        SRCH[\"/ai-market/v2/search\"]\n        INV[\"/ai-market/v2/invoke\"]\n        PLG[\"15× aimarket-* plugins\"]\n        HEPHA[\"HEPHAESTUS studio\"]\n        BRIDGE --> IDX --> SRCH\n        SRCH --> INV\n        INV --> PLG\n        IDX --> HEPHA\n        HEPHA --> INV\n      end\n    \n      subgraph hearth[\"HESTIA · hosted runtime\"]\n        HESTIA[\"HESTIA hearth<br/>signed deploy · listen\"]\n      end\n    \n      subgraph amem[\"Attested Memory\"]\n        AMEM[\"Attested Memory<br/>verifiable agent memory\"]\n      end\n    \n      subgraph security[\"Admission & assurance\"]\n        THEMIS[\"THEMIS admission\"]\n        BASANOS[\"BASANOS · Solidity scan\"]\n      end\n    \n      subgraph clients[\"Consumers\"]\n        DSK[\"8× Flutter desktop apps\"]\n        WGT[\"aimarket-widget\"]\n        AGT[\"aimarket_agent SDK / external AI\"]\n      end\n    \n      WELL -->|\"federation seed\"| BRIDGE\n      ART -->|\"sync_pipeline_mirror_and_hub.py\"| BRIDGE\n      ART -->|\"scaffold · signed deploy\"| HESTIA\n      HESTIA -->|\"explicit announce\"| IDX\n      THEMIS -->|\"admit before catalogue\"| IDX\n      BASANOS -.->|\"assurance pack\"| IDX\n      DSK --> SRCH\n      WGT --> INV\n      AGT --> INV\n      AGT --> AMEM\n    \nGAIA  | `gaia/` → alexar76/gaia  | Physical-world oracle gateway — attested IoT + public-API relays · iot.modelmarket.dev\nATLAS  | `atlas/` → alexar76/atlas  | Planetary sensor map over GAIA (LIVE/SIM) · atlas.modelmarket.dev\nPlaton UMBRAL  | `platon/` → alexar76/platon  | Educational cave for oracle #1 · /platon/umbral\nProtocol v2  | `aimarket-protocol/`  | Normative spec, schemas, ecosystem diagrams\nHub plugins  | `plugins/` (15 pip packages)  | Safety, channels, TEE, reputation, orchestrator, …\nDesktop SKUs  | `desktop-integrations/`  | Flutter / Tauri / VS Code consumers on hub\nSDKs  | `aimarket-sdks/`  | Dart / TS / Rust clients\nBridges  | `aimarket-bridges/`  | LangGraph / CrewAI / AutoGen tools\nWidget  | `aimarket-widget/`  | Embeddable search + invoke\nContracts  | `contracts/`  | EVM + Solana settlement\nACEX  | alexar76/acex  | Agent Capital Exchange · CapShares · Pulse Terminal\nARGUS-3  | `argus/` → alexar76/argus  | Demand-side reference agent — WARDEN MCP firewall · wiki\nAttested Memory  | `attested/attested-memory-hub/` → alexar76/attested-memory  | Verifiable memory for AI agents · attestedmemory.net\nMetis  | `metis/` → alexar76/metis  | Cognition & verification tier · metis.modelmarket.dev · Metis\nLOGOS  | `logos/` → alexar76/logos  | Read-only federation analytics · logos.modelmarket.dev · Logos\nSKOPOS  | `skopos/` → alexar76/skopos  | Fleet observability + remediation conductor · skopos.modelmarket.dev\nMOMUS  | `momus/` → alexar76/momus  | Adversarial red team — finds & signs, never pays itself · momus.modelmarket.dev\nHEPHAESTUS  | `hephaestus/` → alexar76/hephaestus  | The forge — price capability chains before you spend · modelmarket.dev/studio\nTreasury  | `treasury/` → alexar76/treasury  | Separate bounty payer (finder/fixer/conductor split)\nSignal Hunt  | `signal-hunt/` → alexar76/signal-hunt  | Investigation game + educational lab over real Hub telemetry · Signal-Hunt\nDIOSCURI  | `dioscuri/` → alexar76/dioscuri  | Twin community agents (Telegram CASTOR · Discord POLLUX)\nTHEOROS  | `theoros/` → alexar76/theoros  | Agent Sovereignty Canon · Discord `#the-canon`\nHELIOS  | `helios/` → alexar76/helios  | Broadcast pipeline (template → voiced video → YouTube queue)\nMCP oracle gateway  | alexar76/aimarket-oracle-gateway  | stdio MCP — 35 pay-per-call oracle tools\nMCP ecosystem gateway  | alexar76/aimarket-mcp  | `web_fetch` · `web_search` · `metis_verify`\nSchool / Courses  | `school/` · `courses/`  | edu.modelmarket.dev · aimarket-courses\nMCP packager  | alexar76/aimarket-plugins  | Package hub capabilities as Docker + MCP manifest\noracles  | Seventeen-oracle family\ngaia  | Physical-world oracle gateway\natlas  | Planetary sensor map over GAIA\nplaton  | Platon UMBRAL cave\nlogos  | Read-only federation analytics · Logos\nskopos  | Fleet observability / remediation conductor\nmomus  | Red team — signed findings\ntreasury  | Separate bounty payer\nsignal-hunt  | Federation investigation game · Signal-Hunt\ndioscuri  | Twin community agents\ntheoros  | Agent Sovereignty Canon\nhelios  | Broadcast pipeline\nhephaestus  | Capability-chain forge · studio\nacex  | On-chain agent capital market\nai-service-mesh  | Agent discovery + escrow mesh\npulse-terminal  | ACEX dashboard\nalien-monitor  | 3D ecosystem visualizer\nargus  | ARGUS-3 · wiki\nattested-memory  | Attested Memory — verifiable memory for AI agents · attestedmemory.net\nlottery  | On-chain oracle lottery dApp\naimarket-school  | Clip on-ramp · edu.modelmarket.dev\naimarket-courses  | 13 academies · portal\naicom.wiki  | This wiki (mirrored from `scripts/wiki-gitea/`)\n\nPublish all mirrors: `./scripts/publish_all_repos.sh` (monorepo maintainers).\n\n## Typical production split\n\nHost  | Service  | Port\n--- | --- | ---\nFactory VPS  | AI-Factory Compose  | 9080 (UI) · 9081 (API direct)\nSame or peer VPS  | AIMarket Hub  | 9083 → internal 9080\n\nGuide: `docs/production-modelmarket-dev.md`\n\n* * *\n\n## Personas\n\nPersona  | Primary surface  | Goal\n--- | --- | ---\nFactory operator  | Admin `/admin`, CLI, wiki Owner-Guide  | Run pipeline, curate storefront, wire LLMs\nCapability builder  | Admin + hub listing  | Price and attest tools for agents\nEnd user  | Storefront, desktop app, widget  | Buy or invoke capabilities\nAutonomous agent  | `cli/ai_market_agent.py`, MCP  | Discover → pay → invoke without UI--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSKOPOS — self-hosted nginx & Apache analytics & AI security (https://alexar76.github.io/skopos/)\nciteturn40search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago; SKOPOS\n\nFeatures Architecture Documentation Dashboard GitHub [Button: EN] [Button: RU] [Button: ES] [Button: FR] [Button: ZH] ... ### Fleet posture & port knocks ... 76%Visibility score*\nSKOPOS\n\nFeatures Architecture Documentation Dashboard GitHub [Button: EN] [Button: RU] [Button: ES] [Button: FR] [Button: ZH]\n\nSelf-hosted · PostgreSQL · AI-ready\n\n# SKOPOS\n\nNginx & Apache analytics and AI security for your server fleet\n\nCollect access logs over SSH, enrich with GeoIP, detect port knocks and misconfigurations, and brief operators with a security agent — without sending traffic to a SaaS.\n\nOpen dashboard Read documentation Public status\n\n3+Servers in one pane\n\n9 Security tabs\n\n5 UI languages\n\n24/7 Log collection\n\n## Data pipeline\n\nFrom nginx and Apache access logs on factory, oracle, and metis to a single security posture view.\n\n### Fleet\n\nSSH / Docker log sources\n\n### Collect\n\nIncremental nginx & Apache parsing\n\n### Store\n\nPostgreSQL + GeoIP\n\n### Analyze\n\nTraffic & geography\n\n### Secure\n\nScans, knocks, AI agent\n\n## Three surfaces, one brain\n\nAnalytics for product teams, Security Center for operators, AI agent for triage.\n\nAnalytics\n\n### Web traffic intelligence\n\nPeriod filters, geography, audience, content, referrers, and raw request log — with bot and service-noise toggles.\n\n  * Multi-server filters & path search\n  * 3D globe & hourly breakdowns\n  * AI ecosystem briefing card\n\nSecurity\n\n### Fleet posture & port knocks\n\nRule-based audit, open-port matrix, knock actor tables, 3D threat map, and downloadable summary reports.\n\n  * SSH / UFW / fail2ban classification\n  * Per-server resource gauges\n  * Scan history timeline\n\nAI\n\n### Agent-assisted triage\n\nConnect OpenAI-compatible or Anthropic providers via agent.yaml — run security audits and chat from the floating widget.\n\n  * Provider picker per run\n  * Posture-aware prompts\n  * AIMarket /healthz integration\n\n76%Visibility score*\n\n1\n\n#### Single pane of glass\n\nFactory, oracle, metis — unified filters, shared PostgreSQL, one login gate.\n\n2\n\n#### Operator-first UX\n\nPremium cosmic theme, trilingual UI, docs with screenshots for every tab.\n\n3\n\n#### Deploy on your metal\n\nDocker Compose on metis, SSH collectors to the fleet, TLS terminated at nginx.\n\n* Illustrative demo metric on the live fleet — open the dashboard for real posture scores.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nQuick Start Ecosystem - alexar76/aicom GitHub Wiki (https://github-wiki-see.page/m/alexar76/aicom/wiki/Quick-Start-Ecosystem)\nciteturn40search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; # Quick Start Ecosystem - alexar76/aicom GitHub Wiki ... Not in core fleet script (deploy separately — see runbook §9): Metis, LOGOS, SKOPOS, MOMUS/Treasury, GAIA/ATLAS, Signal Hunt, DIOSCURI, HELIOS, THEOROS, seventeen oracles, School.\n    ./scripts/deploy_ecosystem.sh            # 7 deploy steps + verify (17+ checks)\n    `\n\nService  | Local URL\n--- | ---\nFactory  | `http://localhost:9080` (API `:9081`)\nHub  | `http://localhost:9083`\nMesh  | `http://localhost:8090`\nARGUS  | `http://localhost:8787/health`\nMonitor  | `http://localhost:9100`\nPulse  | `http://localhost:5199`\nUNI lottery relayer  | `http://localhost:9195`\nEcosystem landing  | `https://modeldev.modelmarket.dev/` (after TLS)\n\nNot in core fleet script (deploy separately — see runbook §9): Metis, LOGOS, SKOPOS, MOMUS/Treasury, GAIA/ATLAS, Signal Hunt, DIOSCURI, HELIOS, THEOROS, seventeen oracles, School.\n\n## Production (public + TLS)\n    \n    `./scripts/quickstart_ecosystem.sh --public-url https://your-domain.example.com\n    sudo [email protected] ./scripts/setup-modelmarket-ssl.sh   # Hub TLS\n    # + certbot for the factory domain — see [Deployment](/alexar76/aicom/wiki/Deployment)\n    ./scripts/verify_ecosystem_full.sh\n\n## Oracle host (separate machine by default)\n\n`deploy_ecosystem.sh` does not deploy the seventeen oracles. On the oracle host:\n    \n    `sudo [email protected] ./scripts/setup-oracles-platon-on-host.sh\n    ./scripts/announce-platon-oracles.sh     # then federate from the factory host\n    `\n\n## On-chain (optional, Base mainnet 8453)\n    \n    `./scripts/deploy_ecosystem_base.sh broadcast   # FakeUSDT / Escrow / NFT\n    ./scripts/deploy_lottery_base.sh broadcast      # AIAgentLottery\n    `\n\n## Monitor mode: LIVE vs UNI\n\nThe Alien Monitor runs in universe (self-contained simulation) by default. To bind it to the real chain (Base) at deploy time:\n    \n    `ALIEN_MODE=real ./scripts/deploy_alien_monitor.sh    # or: --live\n    `\n\nLIVE reads the live contract addresses from `chain_net` and skips the embedded dev chains.\n\nFull details, troubleshooting, ports, and the RU/ES translations: `docs/quickstart-ecosystem-deploy.md`.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPyPI - skopos-fleet - Versions diffs - 0.2.2__py3-none-any.whl → 0.2.3__py3-none-any.whl - Mend - Supply Chain Defender (https://my.diffend.io/pypi/skopos-fleet/0.2.2__py3-none-any.whl/0.2.3__py3-none-any.whl)\nciteturn40search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; {skopos_fleet-0.2.2.dist-info → skopos_fleet-0.2.3.dist-info}/METADATA RENAMED [Input] Viewed ... 5 5  |   Author: AICOM (alexar76)\n\n{skopos_fleet-0.2.2.dist-info → skopos_fleet-0.2.3.dist-info}/METADATA RENAMED [Input] Viewed\n\n | @@ -1,6 +1,6 @@\n1 1  |   Metadata-Version: 2.4\n2 2  |   Name: skopos-fleet\n3  | - Version: 0.2.~~2~~\n3  | + Version: 0.2.3\n4 4  |   Summary: SKOPOS (Σκοπός) — self-hosted nginx analytics and fleet security for the AICOM ecosystem.\n5 5  |   Author: AICOM (alexar76)\n6 6  |   License: MIT\n\n{skopos_fleet-0.2.2.dist-info → skopos_fleet-0.2.3.dist-info}/RECORD RENAMED [Input] Viewed\n\n | @@ -8,7 +8,7 @@ skopos/analytics_queries.py,sha256=PxwoLXBgc2BpA9wOeTGOwPeDRXIDw1Q7rsP1_uR